# ═══════════════════════════════════════════
#  "SLIDE" — Trap / 808 Banger
#  BeatForge Script Demo Song
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════

bpm 140
swing 10
reverb 0.15
delay 0.1

# ── Drums (hard hitting, rolling hats) ───
kick  "x.....x.....x.x."
snare "....x.......x..."
hh    "x.xxxxxxxxxxx.xx"
oh    "..............x."
clap  "....x.......x..."

# ── Hi-hat velocity pattern ──────────────
# Use shift+click in sequencer to set:
# hh velocity: x.oxxoxxoxoxxoxx
# (alternating hard/soft for bounce)

# ── 808 Bass (slides via pitch control) ──
note "C1.8 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ E1.4 ~ ~ ~ G1.4 ~ ~ ~"

# ── Lead melody (dark, minor key) ────────
# Assign synth on pad 13, use "808 Sub" preset
# Then switch to piano roll and enter:
note "C4 ~ Eb4 ~ F4 ~ Eb4 ~ C4 ~ ~ ~ Bb3 ~ ~ ~"

# ── Song structure ───────────────────────
# Bank A: intro — just 808 + hats (8 bars)
# Bank B: verse — add kick + snare + clap
# Bank C: chorus — double kick pattern + lead
# Bank D: bridge — half-time, remove hats
# Bank E: drop — everything + fast hats

# ── Mix ──────────────────────────────────
# 808 bass: sidechain to kick, filter at 200Hz
# Snare: reverb send 20%, delay send 10%
# Clap: stack with snare (same pattern)
# Master: enhancer 40%, stereo width 110%
# Hi-hats: bitcrusher mix 15% for grit
